{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a70b9aa9dc5a833d9bfd","chatId":"2c5acb90bbd9422d8f093ee81ebb8c56","sessionId":null,"userId":99456,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1145,"promptTokens":402,"completionTokens":106,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:19"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908494412259965,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a70b9aa9dc5a833d9bfc","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483979418,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a70b9aa9dc5a833d9bfc","chatId":"2c5acb90bbd9422d8f093ee81ebb8c56","sessionId":null,"userId":99456,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n我因为朋友没有邀请我参加他的生日派对而感到恼火。然后，我意识到他也在背后对其他人说我坏话。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 生气\nB) 失望\nC) 嫉妒\nD) 紧张\nE) 气恼\nF) 感激\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 虽然我一开始只是恼火，但发现朋友在说我的坏话，我的恼火变成了生气\nB) 我没有被邀请参加生日派对\nC) 我的朋友没有提前告诉我关于派对的事情\nD) 我总是被排除在派对之外","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908494412259965,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a70b9aa9dc5a833d9bfd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483979415,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"860aaa0977db42a08c4ff97c0b37d02c"}